# Force LF line endings regardless of the checking-out OS's core.autocrlf
# setting. The cves-*.jsonl shards rely on being byte-identical between runs
# whenever the underlying data hasn't changed (see export_json.py) -- if
# Windows checked them out as CRLF while the exporter always writes LF,
# every line would show as "changed" on the next commit even with zero real
# content changes, defeating the whole point of the JSON Lines format.
docs/data/cves-*.jsonl -text
